<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Wing Fai Int'l shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Wing Fai Int'l shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of civil engineering group Wing Fai International Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company shares ended HK$0.05 lower at HK$0.78 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Wing Fai International repairs and maintains civil engineering establishments and buildings in the public sector, including Hong Kong's international airport, and installs utilities such as telephone facilities.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
